+# Week 7 - SQL
+
+---
+
+## Assignments:
+* [Songs](https://cs50.harvard.edu/x/psets/7/songs/)
+    - Write SQL queries to answer questions about a database of the 100 most-streamed songs on Spotify in 2018.
+* [Movies](https://cs50.harvard.edu/x/psets/7/movies/)
+    - Write SQL queries to answer questions about a database of movies from IMDB.
+* [Fiftyville](https://cs50.harvard.edu/x/psets/7/fiftyville/)
+    - Find the thief who stole CS50 duck and escaped to another city with the help of an accomplice, using SQL queries find out who the thief is, which city he escaped to and his accomplice.
